      "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade - The Naturalist,&nbsp;Professor Pollution,&nbsp;and Equity.</p><ul>\n<li>Desert Eagle - Haka and The Hippo.</li>\n<li>Glamour - Tachyon, Friction, and Miss Information.</li>\n<li>Magman - Unity and The Radioactivist.</li>\n<li>Ray-Manta - Omnitron-X, Omni-Blade, Partial Omni-Drone.</li>\n<li>Revolt - Setback, Plague Rat, Heartbreaker, and Revenant.</li>\n</ul><p>Biomancer - The Scholar and Hermetic.</p><p>Bugbear - NightMist, Heartbreaker and Man-Grove.</p><ul>\n<li>Quetzalcoatl -&nbsp;Dr. Medico, Mainstay, The Idealist, Writhe, Judge Mental and Crackjaw Crew&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Ammut - Ra, Calypso, and Anubis.</li>\n<li>Cueball - Guise, Green Grosser, and Argentium</li>\n</ul><p>Citizen Hammer&nbsp;- The Visionary, Citizen Anvil, and Major Flay.</p><p>Citizen Anvil - The Visionary, Citizen Hammer, and Major Flay.</p><p>Greazer - Any Hero</p><ul>\n<li>Galactra - Captain Cosmic and Empyreon.</li>\n<li>Rahazar - Parse and Highbrow.</li>\n</ul><p>La Capitan - Chrono-Ranger, Doc Tusser, and Rat Beast.</p><p>Miss Information - FF, VV, Glamour, and&nbsp;\"Barber\" Overbrook.</p><ul>\n<li>Balarian - Argent Adept, Captain Cosmic, Haka, Tempest, Fanatic, Galactra, Desert Eagle, The Idolator, Blood Countess Bathory, Ruin, The Seer, Empyreon, The Hippo, and Vyktor.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Heartbreaker - Mister Fixer, Setback, NightMist, Expatriette, Bugbear, Plague Rat, Revolt, The Operative, Zhu Long, Citizen Slash,&nbsp;Man-Grove, Revenant, and The True Form.</li>\n<li>Judge Mental - Dr. Medico, Mainstay, The Idealist, Writhe,&nbsp;Quetzalcoatl,&nbsp;and Crackjaw Crew .</li>\n<li>Green Grosser - Guise, Cueball, and Argentium.</li>\n</ul><p>Plague Rat - Setback, Revenant, and Revolt.</p><p>Sergeant Steel - KNYFE and Choke.</p><p>The Operative - Mister Fixer, Zhu Long, and The True Form.</p><ul>\n<li>Mayor Overbrook - The Wraith, Ermine, and Miss Information.</li>\n<li>Professor Pollution -&nbsp;The Naturalist, Ambuscade, and Equity.</li>\n<li>The Idolator - Fanatic, Blood&nbsp;Countess Bathory,&nbsp;and The Seer.</li>\n</ul>",
