      "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>Miss Information - 1</span></p><span>The Operative - 1</span></blockquote><p>Huh, that's a little disappointing. &nbsp;I was hoping The Operative would be a 3 or 4 star, but I'll always take some easier difficulty Vengeance villains since I've always found V5 to be really hard.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What makes these two so easy, assuming you've played with them?</p>",
