      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; line-height: 21.6px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Miss Information - 1</span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; line-height: 21.6px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The Operative - 1</span></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; line-height: 21.6px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Huh, that&#39;s a little disappointing. &nbsp;I was hoping The Operative would be a 3 or 4 star, but I&#39;ll always take some easier difficulty Vengeance villains since I&#39;ve always found V5 to be really hard.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; line-height: 21.6px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; line-height: 21.6px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">What makes these two so easy, assuming you&#39;ve played with them?</p>",
